{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Sally's On-The-Job Training", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "The Skills Gap", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 6, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 17, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob06re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Asking for Somebody's Opinion", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can use the following phrases to ask somebody's opinion: <br><br>In your opinion, is it a good idea to ... ?<br> What is your view on ... ? <br>What do you think about ... ?<br> What's your opinion on ... ?<br> Can I have your thoughts on ... ?", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "What is your view on additional training?", "type": "example"}, {"content": " In your opinion, how many articles should I write every month?", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Making and Responding to Requests", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "It's important to be polite when you ask for something or respond to requests.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Making a Request\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Responding to a Request\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Can you ... ?<br> Could you ... ?<br> Will you ... ?<br> Would you mind ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Sure, here you are.<br> Yes, I'd love to!<br> Absolutely. Go ahead.<br> It would be my pleasure.<br>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Could I ask you a few questions?<br><span class=\"strong\">Carl</span>: Absolutely. Go ahead.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Could you explain how you choose topics for articles?<br><span class=\"strong\">Carl</span>: It would be my pleasure. ", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "journalist", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who communicates factual information to the public in different ways ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm a new freelance journalist with Cambridge Life. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob06aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you hear when you talk to a colleague about training.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "article ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a factual text appearing in a newspaper or magazine ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: How many articles should I write every month?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob06aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "skills gap", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the difference between what a person learned in school compared with what they need to learn for a job", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: The skills gap is a major concern for today's young people.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob06aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "deadline ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the last moment you can do something, like submit an assignment", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: It's very important to respect the deadlines.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob06aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "topic", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the subject of a text, article, speech, discussion, etc. ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: How do you choose topics for articles?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob06aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to respect", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to meet; to follow", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: It's important to respect deadlines.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob06aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Talk to 5 people about the idea of \u201cthe skills gap\u201d. Do they think it's a reality? Is it a problem? ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask for reasons.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a short paragraph summarizing people's opinions about the skills gap.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your paragraph aloud.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I talk to 5 people.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask for opinions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a paragraph of 40 - 50 words.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read the paragraph aloud.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn5le17ob06re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn5le17ob06re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  Hello, I'm Sally. I'm a new freelance journalist with <span class=\"italic\">Cambridge Life</span>.  <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Carl</span>: Welcome to the team. I'm Carl.  I'm also a freelance journalist. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  Could I ask you a few questions?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Carl</span>: Absolutely. Go ahead.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: In your opinion, how many articles should I write every month?"}, {"image": "engenn5le17ob06re2img01.jpg", "time": "17500", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Carl</span>: I would say about two articles a week. It's great to have control over our work hours, but it's important to respect deadlines.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Could you explain how you choose topics for articles?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Carl</span>: It would be my pleasure. I talk to people about different things. People love to give their opinions. Ask them questions like, What issues are important to you now?  Or, tell me about something you found surprising or interesting."}, {"image": "engenn5le17ob06re2img06.jpg", "time": "44000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: What is your view on additional training?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Carl</span>: Extra training is always a good idea. There is often a difference between what you learn in college and and what you need to know at work. That's called the skills gap. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Cool, thanks for the suggestions!"}], "audiosrc": "engenn5le17ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le17ob06re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " Do you feel people are prepared to start work when they finish school?   Why or why not? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " I can talk about jobs and work. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can ask for somebody's opinion.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "   I can make and respond to requests.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " What about you?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Lea